Notation. tau = pi, eps = 1.5, d = sqrt(2)|g|/lam, x = tau*d, lam = sqrt(l(l+1)).
  D0(q,pi) = (0, -N q), N = 1/(1+cosh rho).  Cocycle S = exp(tau(X0+gD0)) exp(-tau X0), R2 = S - 1 - gT.
  e_l = (q_l, 0), q_l = exp(-eps h^2) h^2 u;  psi_l = z_l = h^(1/2) q_l/sqrt(2) = h^(5/2) exp(-eps h^2) u/sqrt(2)  (REAL: q slot).
  Spectral weights (derived for the q slot, mu = spectral measure of hu, mass A_l, int p^-2 dmu = ||u||^2 = 4*65536/109395):
    ||e_l||^2            = (1/2) int p^3 coth(pi p)   e^(-2 eps p^2) dmu
    ||coth^(3/2) psi||^2 = (1/2) int p^3 coth^3(pi p) e^(-2 eps p^2) dmu
  N3_hi = min( sqrt((1/2) s3 A_16), sqrt((1/2) s5 ||u||^2) ),  s3 = sup (p coth pi p)^3 e^(-2 eps p^2),  s5 = sup p^2 (p coth pi p)^3 e^(-2 eps p^2)
  E_lo  = J0_lo / sqrt(2 pi ||u||^2):  p coth(pi p) >= 1/pi, then Cauchy-Schwarz  int p^2 e^(-2 eps p^2) dmu >= (int e^(-eps p^2) dmu)^2 / int p^-2 dmu,
          and J0 = int e^(-eps p^2) dmu >= J0_lo = A_inf exp(-eps G_hi^2/A_inf) (ODD-SIGN step 8).
          (The even lane's Jensen step is NOT available: t e^(-2 eps t) is concave at the mean t = G^2/A ~ 0.63 < 1/eps.)
  Rb = N3_hi/E_lo,  K = (1/2)(1+Rb),  C0 = K pi^2
  rem_hi(l,g) = K (e^x - 1 - x) <= C0 e^x g^2/lam^2;   low(l,g) = c|g|/lam - rem_hi(l,g),  c = 2.038e-3 (ODD-SIGN, recomputed by its certified()).
  l_1(g) = max(16, ceil(2*1.001*C0*|g|/c)).
